      "reasons": [
        "The definition’s inclusion of “interview-based ratings” is not supported by the packet text; the packet describes self-report measures (e.g., PPI-R), PCL:SV scores, and empathy-related behavioral and physiological responses, but does not mention interviews or interview-based ratings.",
        "The packet supports a multimethod strategy using multiple measures/sources (e.g., PPI-R self-report, PCL:SV, additional self-report questionnaires such as alexithymia and trait anxiety, and behavioral/physiological measures in an empathy-for-pain experiment), but the definition extends that to a broader rationale (“rather than relying on just one”) that is not explicitly stated in the packet."
